---
const heroImage = "/poster_model.svg";
const cLeft = "/cloudLeft_v2.svg";
const cRight = "/cloudRight_v2.svg";
---

<div class="relative h-screen w-full overflow-hidden">
  <img
    src={cLeft}
    alt=""
    class="absolute left-[20%] top-[10%] w-[20%]"
  />
  <img
    src={heroImage}
    alt=""
    class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 !h-[130%] !w-auto !max-w-none -translate-x-1/2"
  />
  <img
    src={cRight}
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-[5%] top-[80%] w-[30%]"
  />

  <div class="hero-title absolute right-[8%] top-[8%] z-10">
    <h3>第二十六回 和太鼓 早春の陣</h3>
    <h1>
      <ruby>解<rt>ほどき</rt></ruby>　
      <span class="vertical-wave">〜</span>
      春呼びの<ruby>音<rt>ね</rt></ruby>
      <span class="vertical-wave">〜</span>
    </h1>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-info absolute left-[8%] bottom-[8%] z-10">
    <h3>二〇二七年二月二八日（日）午後一時開演</h3>
    <h3>アオーレ長岡 市民交流ホールA</h3>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .hero-title,
  .hero-info {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    text-orientation: upright;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .hero-title::before,
  .hero-info::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: -30px;
    z-index: -1;

    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65) 0%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 50%,
      transparent 85%
    );

    filter: blur(25px);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .vertical-wave {
    display: inline-block;
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }
</style>